window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Soulmates conquer all.</p> <p>Emma: The portal to Edinmyre is closing, and our end is drawing near. If I want the fae to survive, I must unite the Crystals of Harmony, or die trying.</p> <p>Problem is, my death is already sealed, and I’m tired of running from it. Ireland and Scotland hold the answers to the Unseelie stone’s location, yet the path is heavy with secrets. We will continue to fight for the future of the fae, but I already know my fate.</p> <p>The prophecy will come true. I will give up my life for my nation and join the gods in order to meet my destiny.</p> <p>But I don’t think my mate is strong enough to let me go.</p> <p>Ethan: Droga has taken everything. His wrath has spread across the land, and no one has been able to stop him from destroying our country.</p> <p>The dark lord’s magic is immeasurable, and even a king is powerless to stop it. Royalty and power means nothing when evil is unleashed. There is only one person strong enough to stand up to his darkness, and she is my mate.</p> <p>Emma has become the strongest sorceress in the world, and is the only match for Droga’s power. Despite vowing to protect her, I may lose her anyway.</p> <p>That is…unless we create a miracle, and perform magic that has never been done before.</p> <p>We cannot afford to fail. Malovia hangs in the balance.</p>"; 
